  "releaseNotes": "Bug Fixes:\n- upgrade all packages consistently to Orleans 10.4\n  Require Orleans 10.4.0 across OM packages and consuming hosts, with Microsoft.Orleans.Journaling 10.4.0-alpha.1 for the preview integration. Migrate Journaling state-machine registration and recovery while preserving legacy persisted data, and keep enriched Event Hubs tokens compatible with standard provider tokens and cache recovery. Preserve wildcard tracker registration alongside host overrides and custom reminder callback dispatch. Add regression coverage and actionable host upgrade guidance. Retain normal NuGet validation and behavioral consumer suites without an additional compatibility script. The stable packages remain net10.0; consumers must upgrade their Orleans packages consistently.",
